Static structure of aiActivity.cs showing templates, parameters, engine, generated files, and Claude Code as consumer. Yellow-filled nodes are symlinks to the templates base; pink-filled nodes are per-project safe-copies. The engine's lifecycle commands write project files; its inspection commands only read them. Purple numbered edges (1-5) mark Claude Code's startup read order from walk-up to import fan-out; AI-Outputs.org is read on demand and points outside the templates tree. Purple-outlined nodes are the Claude binding; everything else is agent-neutral.
